{"seq":2,"slug":"fx-volatility-handling","title":"汇率波动与价格保护期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/international-pricing-currency/tax-checkout-ops/fx-volatility-handling","wordCount":2257,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"汇率波动与价格保护期\">汇率波动与价格保护期</h1><p>一个市场价定下来之后，汇率会继续动。如果本地价格是用「基准价 × 汇率」算出来的，那么汇率一动，本地价的「正确值」就变了——但价格表里那个数字是用户已经看到并信任的。这个矛盾就是价格保护期要解决的问题：<strong>多长时间内、多大范围内，承诺的价格不因汇率变动而调整。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-波动对毛利的影响量级\">核心概念：波动对毛利的影响量级</h2><p>先量化风险，才能讨论策略。设本地价格为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>（本地币种），成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>（基准币种），当前汇率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span>（本地币种 / 基准币种），则毛利为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M = P - C \\cdot e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当汇率变动 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 时，毛利的变动是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-C \\cdot \\Delta e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span>。注意这个式子里的系数是<strong>成本</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 而不是价格 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>——因为成本是外币计价的，价格已经是本地币种。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mi>M</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><mi>M</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>C</mi><mi>M</mi></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><mi>e</mi></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\Delta M}{M} = -\\frac{C \\cdot \\Delta e}{M} = -\\frac{C}{M} \\cdot \\frac{\\Delta e}{e} \\cdot e = -\\frac{C}{P - C \\cdot e} \\cdot \\Delta e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个结果的实用含义是：<strong>毛利率越低，汇率波动的杀伤力越大</strong>。毛利率 10% 的商品，成本占售价约 90%；汇率上升 5% 时，成本上升约 4.5% 的相对值，毛利被吃掉约 45%。而毛利率 50% 的商品，同样的汇率变动只吃掉约 10% 的毛利。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>毛利率</th>\n<th>成本/售价</th>\n<th>汇率 +5% 时的毛利变化</th>\n<th>汇率 +10% 时</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td>0.90</td>\n<td>−45%</td>\n<td>−90%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>20%</td>\n<td>0.80</td>\n<td>−20%</td>\n<td>−40%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>35%</td>\n<td>0.65</td>\n<td>−9.3%</td>\n<td>−18.6%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>50%</td>\n<td>0.50</td>\n<td>−5%</td>\n<td>−10%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这解释了为什么<strong>低毛利品类必须设价格保护期</strong>，而高毛利品类可以容忍更长的保护期。保护期本质上是在「毛利风险」与「用户信任」之间分配一个预算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"保护期的三种设计\">保护期的三种设计</h2><p>保护期的定义方式有三种，可以叠加使用。</p>\n<p><strong>固定时长保护期。</strong> 价格定稿后 N 天内不因汇率调整。N 的选择取决于该市场的汇率波动率与该品类的毛利。实践中的常见区间是 7 到 30 天。这个方案简单，但问题是「波动率变化时 N 静止」——高波动期应该缩短、低波动期可以延长。</p>\n<p><strong>基于阈值的保护期。</strong> 只有当汇率累计变动超过阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 时才触发调价。这与固定时长正交：阈值管「多大变动才值得动」，时长管「多久之内不动」。阈值的设计要避免临界抖动，因此应该用<strong>非对称阈值</strong>（上调的触发阈值高于下调），且触发后有一个最小间隔。</p>\n<p><strong>基于成本敏感度的分类保护期。</strong> 按品类毛利结构分组，分别设定时长与阈值。低毛利品类（如 3C 配件）用短保护期 + 低阈值；高毛利品类（如服饰）用长保护期 + 高阈值。这个方案最贴合业务，但需要维护分类规则。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[汇率更新事件] --&gt; B[计算对基准的累计变动]&#10;    B --&gt; C{超过该品类阈值?}&#10;    C --&gt;|否| D[不动作]&#10;    C --&gt;|是| E{距上次调价 &gt;= 最小间隔?}&#10;    E --&gt;|否| F[记录待调, 累计到下次]&#10;    E --&gt;|是| G{距定价 &gt;= 保护期?}&#10;    G --&gt;|否| H[进入待调队列]&#10;    G --&gt;|是| I[生成调价建议]&#10;    I --&gt; J{人工审批?}&#10;    J --&gt;|低毛利品类| K[自动执行 + 通知]&#10;    J --&gt;|其他| L[进入审批流]\">graph TD\n    A[汇率更新事件] --&gt; B[计算对基准的累计变动]\n    B --&gt; C{超过该品类阈值?}\n    C --&gt;|否| D[不动作]\n    C --&gt;|是| E{距上次调价 &gt;= 最小间隔?}\n    E --&gt;|否| F[记录待调, 累计到下次]\n    E --&gt;|是| G{距定价 &gt;= 保护期?}\n    G --&gt;|否| H[进入待调队列]\n    G --&gt;|是| I[生成调价建议]\n    I --&gt; J{人工审批?}\n    J --&gt;|低毛利品类| K[自动执行 + 通知]\n    J --&gt;|其他| L[进入审批流]</pre><p>图中的「进入待调队列」这一步很重要：<strong>保护期内不调价，但也不遗忘</strong>。累计的偏差在保护期结束时一次性释放，如果积累量大，释放时应该分批而不是一次性跳变。</p>\n<h2 id=\"待调队列与价格跳变\">待调队列与价格跳变</h2><p>保护期结束时一次性把价格调整 8%，会造成用户在一天内看到价格突变，这在心理上比逐步调整更糟。因此待调队列的释放策略应该是<strong>分批接近目标值</strong>。</p>\n<p>设目标汇率变动为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span>，希望用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 步释放：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>第 </mtext><mi>i</mi><mtext> 步调整比例</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>δ</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{第 } i \\text{ 步调整比例} = \\frac{\\delta}{k} \\cdot i, \\qquad i = 1, \\dots, k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">第</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">步调整比例</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>步长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 与单步间隔需要与该品类的价格敏感度匹配。一个实用的约束是<strong>单步调整不超过 3%</strong>——这是很多电商在价格变动上经验性的心理阈值，超过这个幅度会触发用户的比价行为。</p>\n<p>需要注意，分批释放会延长系统「实际价格偏离理论价格」的时间。因此必须监控一个指标：<strong>价格偏离度</strong> = (当前本地价 − 理论价) / 理论价。偏离度长期为正说明定价偏高（有竞争力风险），长期为负说明定价偏低（毛利被侵蚀）。这个指标应该按市场聚合，作为定价团队的常态看板。</p>\n<h2 id=\"单向波动-为什么降价快-涨价慢\">单向波动：为什么降价快、涨价慢</h2><p>电商的价格调整在实践中是<strong>非对称</strong>的：汇率朝着让成本下降的方向变动时，降价可以快；朝着让成本上升的方向变动时，涨价应该慢。三个理由：</p>\n<p><strong>竞争约束。</strong> 竞争对手的涨价决策与你不同步，先涨价的一方会短期失去价格优势。因此涨价需要更谨慎的时机。</p>\n<p><strong>用户信任。</strong> 用户对「变贵」的敏感度远高于「变便宜」。频繁涨价的站点会被贴上「价格不稳定」的标签。</p>\n<p><strong>合同与承诺。</strong> 一些市场有明确的标价承诺（比如在广告中标注的价格在一定期内有效）：欧盟《综合指令》（Directive (EU) 2019/2161）新增的第 6a 条要求任何降价公告必须标示「原价」，且原价一般是降价前至少 30 天内的最低价（见 <a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX%3A32019L2161），违反会触发消费者保护法规的处罚。\">https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX%3A32019L2161），违反会触发消费者保护法规的处罚。</a></p>\n<p>因此保护期的参数应该是成对的：<code>protective_period_up</code>（涨价保护期，长）与 <code>protective_period_down</code>（降价保护期，短），而不是单一值。同样地，阈值也成对。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与本地定价策略的交互\">与本地定价策略的交互</h2><p>价格保护期与 <a href=\"../localized-pricing/psychological-rounding\">本地心理定价与舍入规则</a> 有一个直接冲突：<strong>调整后的价格必须重新经过心理定价的舍入</strong>，而舍入是向上取的，这会放大涨价、但也会削弱降价的幅度（因为向上取整意味着降价总是不够多）。</p>\n<p>处理方式是在调价管线上明确顺序：先按汇率算出目标价，再按阈值与保护期判断是否调，最后过心理定价舍入。舍入之后如果结果与原价相同（比如步长太小，舍入后回到原值），应该跳过这次调整并计入队列——否则会产生大量「调了等于没调」的无效变更，污染变更日志。这个顺序与 <a href=\"../fx-conversion/money-precision-rounding\">整数分、Decimal 与币种舍入</a> 里「舍入只发生在定价流程、不发生在请求链路」是同一条设计原则的两个应用面。</p>\n<p>另外，<strong>保护期与活动价的关系需要明确定义</strong>。一个在保护期内的商品做了促销活动，活动结束后的价格是回到保护期内的原价，还是回到按新汇率算出的价？推荐的做法是：<strong>活动价只在活动期内有效，活动结束回到市场价，市场价的调整仍受保护期约束</strong>。这样两条轨道互不干扰，用户看到的「活动结束恢复原价」与承诺一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"监控-把波动变成可观测的量\">监控：把波动变成可观测的量</h2><p>保护期机制要能持续运作，需要四个监控指标：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>价格偏离度</td>\n<td>(当前价 − 理论价)/理论价，按市场聚合</td>\n<td>发现保护期设置过长或过短</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>待调队列深度</td>\n<td>队列中的 SKU 数与平均等待天数</td>\n<td>发现阈值设置不当导致积压</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调价频率</td>\n<td>每市场每日调价 SKU 数</td>\n<td>防止高频跳变伤害体验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>毛利侵蚀率</td>\n<td>因汇率未及时调整导致的毛利损失金额</td>\n<td>量化保护期的成本，供管理层决策</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一个指标是让讨论从「我们要保护用户信任」变成「我们每月为保护用户信任支付 X 元」的关键。保护期不是免费的，把它变成数字，才能做权衡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>汇率波动对毛利的杀伤力与毛利率成反比：成本/售价 0.90 的品类在汇率 +5% 时毛利掉 45%，低毛利品类必须设保护期。</li>\n<li>保护期由时长、阈值、品类敏感度三个维度定义，可叠加；阈值应非对称且带最小调价间隔。</li>\n<li>保护期内不调价但进待调队列，队列释放应分批（单步不超过约 3%），避免价格跳变。</li>\n<li>价格调整非对称：涨价保护期长、降价保护期短，由竞争、用户信任、法规承诺三个约束决定。</li>\n<li>调价顺序是「汇率算目标价 → 阈值与保护期判断 → 心理定价舍入」；舍入后回到原值则跳过，避免无效变更。</li>\n<li>活动价与市场价是两条轨道，活动结束回市场价，市场价调整仍受保护期约束。</li>\n<li>用「毛利侵蚀率」把保护期的成本数字化，让保护期长度成为可决策而非默认的参数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"汇率波动与价格保护期","id":"汇率波动与价格保护期"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：波动对毛利的影响量级","id":"核心概念-波动对毛利的影响量级"},{"level":2,"text":"保护期的三种设计","id":"保护期的三种设计"},{"level":2,"text":"待调队列与价格跳变","id":"待调队列与价格跳变"},{"level":2,"text":"单向波动：为什么降价快、涨价慢","id":"单向波动-为什么降价快-涨价慢"},{"level":2,"text":"与本地定价策略的交互","id":"与本地定价策略的交互"},{"level":2,"text":"监控：把波动变成可观测的量","id":"监控-把波动变成可观测的量"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"关税/VAT 试算引擎","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/international-pricing-currency/tax-checkout-ops/duty-tax-estimation"},"next":{"title":"展示价与实付一致性校验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/international-pricing-currency/tax-checkout-ops/pricing-consistency"}}